OL,3,AThree arrested after raid on gang
OL,4,Aaccused of helping migrants pretend to
OL,5,Abe gay to get asylum
OL,6,
OL,7,FThose targeted by Home Office
OL,8,Fimmigration enforcement officers this
OL,9,Fmorning are accused of charging
OL,10,Fmigrants up to #4,500 for fabricated
OL,11,Fevidence, including staged photographs
OL,12,Fand fake documents.
OL,14,FThey are thought to have aided dozens
OL,15,Fof asylum claims from Bangladeshi men,
OL,16,Fclaiming they would be in fear for
OL,17,Ftheir lives if they returned home.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
