OL,3,AI'd rather have another election than
OL,4,Ado a deal with Reform UK, says Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FKemi Badenoch has said she would rather
OL,7,Fhave another general election than do a
OL,8,Fdeal with Reform UK to secure power, if
OL,9,Fno party wins the next election.
OL,11,FThe Conservative Party leader told the
OL,12,FBBC that Nigel Farage's Reform are
OL,13,F"neck deep in scandal" and joining
OL,14,Fforces with them would "just be one
OL,15,Fproblem after another".
OL,17,FPolling suggests there would be a hung
OL,18,Fparliament at the next election, with
OL,19,FLabour currently expected to be the
OL,20,Flargest party followed by Reform and
OL,21,Fthe Tories.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
