OL,3,AI'd rather have another election than
OL,4,Ado a deal with Reform UK, says Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the Conservative Party conference in
OL,7,FBirmingham nears its end, Badenoch has
OL,8,Falso pledged to cut the cost of hiring
OL,9,F21 to 24-year-olds by halving the rate
OL,10,Fof employer national insurance (NI)
OL,11,Fcontributions.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
